<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2714] Cleanup GridOffHeapPartitionedMap when cache is destroyed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2714</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For cache with offheap enabled GridOffHeapPartitionedMap is created (see GridOffHeapProcessor).  But this GridOffHeapPartitionedMap is not removed when cache is destroyed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
